 that contains $R,$ then the divergence theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS={∭}_{R}\\text{div}\\,F\\,\\text{d}V.\n$$\n\nComputing the divergence of $F,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{div}\\,F & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3x+y{e}^{z})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(xy+2)+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(1-xz) \\\\  & =3+x+(-x) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $R$ be the rectangular solid enclosed by $S.$ Then, using the divergence theorem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot dS & ={∭}_{R}3\\,\\text{d}V \\\\  & =3{∭}_{R}\\,\\text{d}V \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\text{Volume}(R) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 1\\cdot 2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =18.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371385 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371386 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371387 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371388 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371389 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1041 "selection" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1104 #edb/ref 17592186371388 13194139535868 true] [17592186371384 1110 #uuid "dd8f3189-2922-5ad5-80f7-e76b43bad640" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371385 1034 "12" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371385 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535868 true] [17592186371385 1111 #uuid "17c8f4c9-337e-549f-9444-4204dc6085de" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371386 1034 "16" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371386 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535868 true] [17592186371386 1111 #uuid "68efd64f-4583-553c-ad4a-b8f9a8843333" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371387 1034 "21" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371387 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535868 true] [17592186371387 1111 #uuid "b861f96d-c51c-571c-82e0-8bac5a5eda7b" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371388 1034 "18" 13194139535868 true] [17592186371388 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535868 true] [17592186371388 1111 #uuid "91817b8b-b